  EXCLUSIVE: NEW FOOTAGE Shows FBI Agents Spotted ON 925 S ST in
  Orem Just Hours After Kirk Assassination
  I just obtained footage showing FBI agents combing for evidence in Orem
  just hours after Charlie Kirk was assassinated at UVU.
  I Location: 670 925 Street, Orem - agents sweeping the area, going yard
  to yard, clearly looking for something they don't want the public to see.
  Remember - officials have released only a couple blurry stills and one
  sketchy "roof jump" video... yet here's proof they were all over the
  neighborhood that SAME DAY.
  Why have we NOT see any more video from the neighborhood that day, nor
  videos of the Challenger.
  • • Watch closely. The story they've told us has more holes than Swiss
  cheese.
  Shoutout to @BluB40550 for bringing this to me. please FOLLOW her.
